{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Funding for specialist police to tackle antisocial behaviour on illegal e-bikes",
        "additional_details": "Most of us will have seen young people, wearing balaclavas to hide their identity, riding these bikes on our roads with total disregard for the law or our safety. However, specialist motorbike drone units will be able to track and follow the bikes, arrest the riders and, destroy their bikes. We believe this will be a strong deterrent.",
        "background": "Funding to be made available to police forces to tackle illegal off road electric motorbikes and anti social behaviour. This funding could be used for specialist motorbike drone units designed to catch and prosecute those involved in the behaviours outlined above and make our communities safer.",
